1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:59,690
Greetings, Senior.

25
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:09,610
Qiu Siping
Late Stage Core Formation

26
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:10,010
So there really is someone skilled in ancient restrictions.

27
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,650
Ancient restrictions ?

28
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:15,130
Senior, can you help me ?

29
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,250
It's not that difficult

30
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,370
but you must tell me

31
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:23,770
who placed this restriction on you.

32
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:26,210
If Senior can break it,

33
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:28,970
Junior will tell you everything.

34
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:31,410
I’ll give it a try then.

35
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:39,930
What is this !?

36
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:01,610
I won't let you go !

37
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:14,730
I must use this beast

38
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:17,650
to lure out the person who knows ancient restrictions.

39
00:03:58,720 --> 00:04:00,370
Fellow cultivator can calm down.

40
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:02,330
You must be the one

41
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:04,490
who placed this ancient restriction.

42
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:08,010
Fellow cultivator, I don't have any any malicious intent.

43
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:10,490
I have an opportunity to offer you.

44
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:13,650
We're complete strangers

45
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,930
about to fight each other to death.

46
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:18,330
Why should I trust you ?

47
00:04:18,640 --> 00:04:20,490
To be honest,

48
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,890
we’re both Late stage Core Formation

49
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:24,890
hoping to form a Nascent Soul.

50
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:28,890
If fellow cultivator is willing to lend me a hand,

51
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:29,850
I can guarantee

52
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:33,170
that fellow cultivator will be able to form a Nascent Soul.

53
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,530
I know where

54
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:39,290
you can devour a defenseless Nascent Soul

55
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:43,130
to greatly increase your chance of forming your Nascent Soul.

56
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,610
I know of a place

57
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:49,010
where 2 Nascent Souls are in sleeping.

58
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:50,570
If we succeed,

59
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,330
both of us

60
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:54,650
will get a Nascent Soul to absorb.

61
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,330
What do you think ?

62
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:05,410
How do you know about these Nascent Souls ?

63
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:09,330
One of them

64
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,890
is my Senior Brother.

65
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:14,290
The other is my master.

66
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,530
Killing your own teacher ?

67
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,970
Nothing unusual,

68
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,890
I’ve done that before.

69
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:23,410
Master wanted to increase his cultivation

70
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:25,370
so he planned to refine me.

71
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:27,650
He thought I was clueless

72
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:31,170
but I had seen through his scheme long ago.

73
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:33,730
30 years ago,

74
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:36,090
while he was in seclusion with my Senior Brother,

75
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:38,170
I sabotaged them during cultivation

76
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:39,770
to make them fall asleep.

77
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:41,370
It's been a few days

78
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:44,130
since their consciousness were consumed by inner demons.

79
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:47,610
It's the best time to absorb their Nascent Souls.

80
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:51,090
What does this have to do with ancient restrictions ?

81
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,410
They cultivated

82
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:59,730
in an ancient cultivator's cave.

83
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,930
It contains too many restrictions.

84
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:04,090
If you trigger one, you trigger them all.

85
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,850
If I force my way in,

86
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:08,650
there might be nothing left for me to obtain.

87
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:12,410
That’s why I need fellow cultivator’s help.

88
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:15,490
Master is Early stage Nascent Soul

89
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:17,370
and Senior Brother had just broken through.

90
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,650
If fellow cultivator can open the restrictions,

91
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:21,770
then Master’s Nascent Soul

92
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:23,050
will be yours.

93
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,530
We're almost there.

94
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,250
It's right here.

95
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:46,970
Entering this gate will trigger a restriction.

96
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:49,770
I leave everything to fellow cultivator.

97
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:05,410
This beast is condensed from spiritual energy.

98
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:08,050
As long as the stone wall keeps supplying energy,

99
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,530
it cannot be killed !

100
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:11,690
While fighting it,

101
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:14,770
hidden restrictions in the walls will also launch attacks

102
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:16,730
that are hard to defend against !

103
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:22,690
Fellow cultivator, let's first destroy those walls !

104
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,490
Fighting this beast is useless !

105
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:32,690
As expected,

106
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,690
it wasn't the walls powering the beast

107
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:37,490
but the beast supplying the entire restriction.

108
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:40,490
Hiding the restriction's core here

109
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:43,610
really is the work of a restriction master.

110
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,330
However,

111
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:48,850
compared to the Ancient God's restrictions,

112
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:50,410
it's too weak.

113
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:57,490
Fellow cultivator’s knowledge in restrictions

114
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,930
is really something else !

115
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:09,290
An Ancient Teleportation Formation ?

116
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:13,610
Fellow cultivator,

117
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:16,330
Master and Senior Brother are inside this chamber.

118
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:32,090
Fellow cultivator, farewell !

119
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,330
Now,

120
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:37,290
after I craft the Restriction Flag

121
00:08:37,040 --> 00:08:38,970
I will form my Nascent Soul.

122
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:39,970
I need to place 999 restrictions on this flag

123
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:42,330
to refine a Restriction Flag of the lowest level.

124
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:07,170
2 days later

125
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,610
I did it !

126
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,170
What’s going on !?

127
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,250
Could it be ?

128
00:10:47,640 --> 00:10:48,810
Look !

129
00:10:58,040 --> 00:11:00,610
Divine Retribution ? How is this possible ?

130
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:04,130
Since the ancient cultivation world was destroyed,

131
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,970
Divine Retribution ceased to appear.

132
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:07,770
Could it be an ancient artifact ?

133
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:10,130
That would be excellent nourishment

134
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,810
Such massive tribulation clouds...

135
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:17,090
It must be the appearance of a supreme artifact !

136
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:46,290
Ancient Gods often triggered Divine Retribution.

137
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:48,490
The stronger the tribulation,

138
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:50,450
the more powerful the artifact.

139
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:53,450
This tribulation is here to destroy the Restriction Flag !

140
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,730
Now or never !

141
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:18,010
My Golden Core can barely withstand this lightning.

142
00:13:17,760 --> 00:13:20,170
If this continues, it will shatter.

143
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:22,930
I need to cultivate right now.

144
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:33,330
Hand over the ancient artifact

145
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,450
and I'll spare your life !

146
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,730
Hand over the artifact !

147
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,730
Be reasonable !

148
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:04,890
You can’t escape !

149
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:05,730
Hand over the artifact !

150
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:33,170
Nothing I ever wanted has ever escaped my grasp !

151
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:36,730
Nascent Soul ?

152
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:39,050
Little brat, die !

153
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:16,290
Break !

154
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:23,050
Search for him !

155
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:24,850
A mere Late stage Core Formation

156
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:26,850
couldn't have vanished into thin air !

157
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:43,450
Find him !

158
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:46,130
Dig into the ground if you must !

159
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:48,610
Since you all tried to kill me,

160
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:52,250
then you can't blame me for it !

161
00:15:55,880 --> 00:15:58,090
Divine Sense, disperse !

162
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:16,890
He instantly killed 100 people !?

163
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:17,890
Retreat !

164
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:58,210
Wang Lin
Peak Late stage Core Formation

165
00:16:57,640 --> 00:17:00,130
What kind of luck does this guy have !?

166
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:01,890
Not only did he survive the Divine Retribution

167
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:04,650
but he also reached Peak Late stage Core Formation !

168
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:06,130
Damn it !

169
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:08,490
Who can I even complain to ?

170
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:13,770
Congratulations Master,

171
00:17:13,520 --> 00:17:15,650
you turned that misfortune into fortune !

172
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:16,850
If you devour this Nascent Soul

173
00:17:16,600 --> 00:17:18,410
you will reach Nascent Soul for sure !

174
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:24,370
The Ji Realm will overpower your peers of the same level.

175
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,490
But it also limits the user.

176
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,250
There has never been

177
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:29,810
a Ji Realm user who has broken through

178
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:31,610
above the level of Nascent Soul.

179
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:34,410
You won't be able to reach higher levels.

180
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:40,090
My cultivation will stop at Nascent Soul...

181
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:42,650
But I refuse to accept it !

182
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:38,410
All the stars were aligned

183
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:42,650
but the Ji Realm still prevented me from breaking through !

184
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:45,410
My success comes from the Ji Realm

185
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:47,450
and now my downfall comes from the Ji Realm !

186
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:53,530
Master... Fate is unpredictable...

187
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:54,610
You..

188
00:18:57,280 --> 00:18:59,930
I never believed in fate !

189
00:19:03,230 --> 00:21:19,050
A Divine Retribution is the manifestation of the heavens' rejection towards something. The heavens send a tribulation to eradicate what they don't allow to exist. They appear as tribulation clouds that strike lightining to destroy whatever it is that defied the heavens.

If the person or object passes the tribulation, it is allowed to exist. Depending on the level of defiance towards the heavens, they can send either a single lightining or multiple clouds with ascending difficulty.

A heaven defying artifact like the Restriction Flag can cause a tribulation to fall but since it was only the first level of 999 restriction is was weak enough be passed with a little help from Wang Lin.

As the tribulation lighting invaded his body, Wang Lin had no choice but to kill the hundreds of cultivators to swallow their Golden Cores in order to stabilize his cultivation and refine that lightning. That is only possible thanks to the Ancient God Tactic that allows him to devour absurd amounts of spiritual energy without his body exploding.

What isn't said here is that he now has a refined tribulation lightning inside his body that he can use to call the tribulation back.

190
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:15,650
I've had my share of wounds,

191
00:19:13,560 --> 00:19:15,650
now I want to fight back.

192
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:19,210
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

193
00:19:19,040 --> 00:19:25,130
that's blocking all my hopes

194
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:25,130
for life ?

195
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:30,890
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

196
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:30,890
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

197
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:34,290
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

198
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:40,290
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

199
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:40,290
out of reach.

200
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:45,770
Immortals

201
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:45,770
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

202
00:19:45,800 --> 00:19:49,810
Renegades

203
00:19:46,560 --> 00:19:49,810
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

204
00:19:49,560 --> 00:19:53,650
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

205
00:19:51,510 --> 00:19:53,650
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

206
00:19:53,640 --> 00:19:57,770
because I don't see the harm in that.

207
00:19:59,520 --> 00:20:05,570
My new body opens its eyes

208
00:20:02,040 --> 00:20:05,570
and awakens from its dream.

209
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:13,130
I have overcome many trials

210
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:13,130
to get this body back.

211
00:20:13,080 --> 00:20:20,770
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

212
00:20:17,120 --> 00:20:20,770
I can still see.

213
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:30,130
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

214
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:30,130
by my own hands.

215
00:20:45,320 --> 00:20:51,530
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

216
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:51,530
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

217
00:20:51,280 --> 00:20:59,090
With a flick of a finger,

218
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:59,090
only my indomitable heart remains.

219
00:20:58,880 --> 00:21:08,490
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

220
00:21:04,840 --> 00:21:08,490
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

221
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:16,330
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

222
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:16,330
like the descent of a god.
